' ===========================================================================
' PDS.BM - the BASIC PDS 7.1 form of QB64.BM, for the bridge of
' docs\port-study.md (step 7). tools\pdsbuild.py puts it into the strategic
' game's main module in place of QB64.BM. PDS 7.1 has DIR$ itself, so only
' styledline is here.
' ===========================================================================

' The plain LINE with a style, which is what DOS drew: QB64.BM draws the same
' pixels pixel by pixel. The style is the 16 bits of style&, as an INTEGER.
SUB styledline (xa, ya, xb, yb, c, style&)
s = style& AND &H7FFF&
IF style& AND &H8000& THEN s = s OR &H8000
LINE (xa, ya)-(xb, yb), c, , s
END SUB
